    {
      "name": "Hybrid Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "D.Va's Hybrid Build is designed to increase your survivability, so that you can be more aggressive and less at risk in team fights, indirectly allowing you to deal more damage.\n\nThe survivability comes from the ability to enter in a new Mech faster thanks to Nuclear Option at Level 4 and the Shield provided by Emergency Shielding at Level 16 while in Mech Mode.\n\nYou also get to play Hit the Nitrous at Level 7 to interrupt enemy Heroes. If you do not need that, you can replace it with Get On The Point! to rotate faster.",
