    {
      "name": "Boosters Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "D.Va's Boosters Build increases your waveclear in the early game and your damage done to enemy Heroes in the late game.\n\nThe waveclear comes from Rush-down at Level 4, which can be used to finish off enemy Minions and start rotating to another lane.\n\nThe damage output increase is provided by In For The Kill at Level 16, but remember it only increases your Attack Damage when you hit enemy Heroes with Boosters.\n\nYou also get to play Hit the Nitrous at Level 7 to interrupt enemy Heroes. If you do not need that, you can replace it with Get On The Point! to rotate faster.",
